# mover: interactive renaming of the files of its working folder (its listing fixed by mover.shims/ls, five names that do not exist): the script
# picks alpha.txt, types its new name in the Rename dialog (drawn in the window's middle), and since mv finds no such file the program says
# Renaming failed; Return dismisses the notice, and File > quit ends it.
click 1 60 56
wait
move 300 190
type omega.txt
key Return
wait
move 300 200
key Return
wait
move 18 11
press 1
wait
move 30 48
release 1
